# Privacy Policy

MarkeTrade, developed and operated by BIL♧DOX, takes your privacy seriously. This privacy policy explains how your personal information is collected, used, and protected.

## Collection of Routine Information

MarkeTrade tracks basic information about its users. This information includes, but is not limited to, IP addresses, app details, timestamps, and referring pages. None of this information can personally identify specific users of MarkeTrade. This information is tracked for routine administration and maintenance purposes.

## Collection of Location Data

MarkeTrade may collect and use precise location data, including the real-time geographic location of your device. This information is used to provide location-based services that are part of the app's functionality, such as displaying relevant content or services based on your location.

We do not share your location data with third parties without your explicit consent, except as required by law or to provide the services requested.

If you do not wish for your location data to be used, you may disable location services in your device settings or within the app. However, disabling location services may affect the functionality of certain features within the app.

## Cookies

Where necessary, MarkeTrade uses cookies to store information about a visitor’s preferences and history to better serve users and/or present customized content.

You can choose to disable cookies through your browser or device settings, though some app features may not function properly if cookies are disabled.

## Advertisement and Other Third Parties

Advertising partners and other third parties may use cookies, scripts, and/or web beacons to track users' activities on MarkeTrade to display advertisements and other useful information. Such tracking is done directly by the third parties through their own servers and is subject to their own privacy policies. MarkeTrade has no access to or control over these cookies, scripts, or web beacons that may be used by third parties. Learn how to opt out of Google’s cookie usage.

## Links to Third Party Websites

MarkeTrade may include links for your use and reference. We are not responsible for the privacy policies of these external websites. Please be aware that their privacy policies may differ from our own.

## Security

The security of your personal information is important to us. However, please note that no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your personal information, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.

## Data Retention and Deletion

MarkeTrade retains personal data only as long as necessary to provide the services described in this policy. Users may request data deletion by contacting us at the email address provided below. Once requested, personal data will be securely deleted from our servers within 30 days.

